---
// 實際案場：分「商辦」與「廠辦」兩區塊，實績公司 icon 在固定範圍內緩緩漂浮。
// 要新增實績：把 logo 放進 public/clients/，再於對應區塊的 clients 陣列加一筆即可。
// 每筆 pos 為漂浮欄位中的初始落點（百分比），刻意錯開避免重疊。
const zones = [
  {
    key: 'commercial',
    label: '商辦',
    desc: '辦公大樓的中央空調、公區照明與電梯等公共用電，導入後由系統統一監看與最佳化。',
    clients: [
      {
        name: '工研院 ITRI',
        logo: '/clients/itri.png',
        url: 'https://www.itri.org.tw',
        pos: { x: 50, y: 46 },
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    key: 'factory',
    label: '廠辦',
    desc: '結合生產設備與廠務用電，掌握產線與空壓、冰水主機等高耗能設備的能耗分布。',
    clients: [],
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="cases">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Track Record</span>
      <h2>實際案場</h2>
      <p>從商業辦公到生產廠辦，JOULARIS 已在不同型態的建物落地服務。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="zones">
      {
        zones.map((zone) => (
          <div class="card zone">
            <div class="zone-head">
              <span class={`zone-tag zone-tag-${zone.key}`}>{zone.label}</span>
              <p class="zone-desc">{zone.desc}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="float-field">
              {zone.clients.length > 0 ? (
                zone.clients.map((c, i) => (
                  <a
                    class="chip"
                    href={c.url}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    style={`left:${c.pos.x}%;top:${c.pos.y}%;--i:${i};--dur:${9 + (i % 4) * 1.5}s`}
                  >
                    <img src={c.logo} alt={c.name} width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" />
                    <span>{c.name}</span>
                  </a>
                ))
              ) : (
                <p class="float-empty">實績持續累積中</p>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .zones {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .zone {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 28px 28px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .zone-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* 區塊標籤：商辦偏綠、廠辦偏藍，沿用品牌雙色 */
  .zone-tag {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 5px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .zone-tag-commercial {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--c-green-deep), var(--c-teal));
  }

  .zone-tag-factory {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--c-teal), var(--c-blue));
  }

  .zone-desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* 漂浮欄位：固定高度，chip 以絕對定位落點後在小範圍內漂浮 */
  .float-field {
    position: relative;
    height: 220px;
    margin: 0 -28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 55%, transparent);
  }

  .chip {
    position: absolute;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 16px 8px 10px;
    /* 以落點為中心，再套漂浮位移 */
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgb(36 50 48 / 0.12);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: float-chip var(--dur, 10s) ease-in-out calc(var(--i, 0) * -1.7s)
      infinite;
    transition: box-shadow 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--c-teal);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgb(36 50 48 / 0.2);
  }

  .chip img {
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* 位移刻意控制在小範圍內，讓 chip 像懸浮而非四處游移 */
  @keyframes float-chip {
    0% {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }
    25% {
      transform: translate(calc(-50% + 7px), calc(-50% - 11px));
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(calc(-50% - 9px), calc(-50% - 3px));
    }
    75% {
      transform: translate(calc(-50% + 4px), calc(-50% + 9px));
    }
    100% {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }
  }

  .float-empty {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .zones {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .float-field {
      height: 190px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .chip {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
